6. The admitted-facts are:
i) that the accident is due to the negligence of the driver of the Car bearing no.KA-01-P-1500 - Divakar and the Police have filed the 'Abated Charge Sheet' as per Ex.P.6, against him;
ii) that the petitioners have filed this petition under Section 166 of M.V.Act claiming the Fixed Amount of Rs.15,00,000/- as compensation in view of the additional-premium paid towards the Personal Accident Cover under the Policy of the Car bearing no.KA-01-P-1500;
G.A. Pushpa vs Harisha.H on 4 September, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/135393576/
4 iii) that the RC & Policy of the Car bearing no.KA-01-P- 1500 as per Ex.P.14 & 16 respectively, are standing in the name of Respondent no.1 as per Ex.P.16, although deceased Divakar during his life-time is stated to have purchased the same;
iv) that as per the Policy at Ex.P.16, the Insurance of the Car bearing no.KA-01-P-1500 was 'in force'
as on the date of accident; and the an additional premium of Rs.275/- has been paid towards the Personal Accident Cover of Rs.15,00,000/- to the Owner Driver of the Car.
